# Ways to pay a renewal down faster. Example inputs, with the posted 5 year rate from the Bank of Canada.

mortgage "Monthly"
  balance $380,000
  rate posted 5 year on 2026-11-18 fixed
  amortization 22 years
  term 5 years

scenario "Accelerated biweekly"
  payments accelerated biweekly

scenario "Extra $250 a month"
  extra $250 per payment

scenario "Lump sum each year"
  lump $6,000 every year

compare all by payment, yearly, interest, balance, payoff
show yearly "Lump sum each year"
show interest of "Monthly" - interest of "Lump sum each year"

# Interest Act, s. 10: on a mortgage for more than five years, after five years
# the borrower can repay with three months further interest. This shows three months of
# interest at the contract rate on the balance at the end of the term.
show three months interest of "Monthly"
